      "content": "i've been looking at some transcripts from the last few G7 summits and i keep noticing these weird linguistic patterns. like, certain phrases are used in almost identical ways even when the context is totally different. it feels less like standard diplomatic jargon and more like a specific code or something. do u think it's possible there's a layer of communication happening under the surface that isn't meant for the public?",
